{"name": "SLAM TANK", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"45\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/a5bb213d7508120be4a2f89976463bfe.webp?t=1792410424\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/339f64e157a6ebe361a292ebdfaaef3d.poster.avif?t=1792410424\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/339f64e157a6ebe361a292ebdfaaef3d.webm?t=1792410424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/339f64e157a6ebe361a292ebdfaaef3d.mp4?t=1792410424\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An AI has taken control of the world\u2019s machines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from three tanks, each with a distinct combat style, and fight to reclaim the world. <br/>Spin the turret, swing your cannon barrel, and ram straight through enemy ranks. <br/>Chain drifts, attacks, and unique abilities to tear through enemy hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"45\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/4b34b51eee5246f0176e541156b04e88.webp?t=1792410424\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/0c27ff03b087a7d8a7f0709a4c230ee7.poster.avif?t=1792410424\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/0c27ff03b087a7d8a7f0709a4c230ee7.webm?t=1792410424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/0c27ff03b087a7d8a7f0709a4c230ee7.mp4?t=1792410424\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Massive industrial machines block your path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge their attacks, close the gap, and chain barrel strikes with powerful abilities to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"45\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/08d228a5fca2771307667fc735ad6ee0.webp?t=1792410424\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/5763d5cf5cb28a4788acf8d5eb41d471.poster.avif?t=1792410424\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/5763d5cf5cb28a4788acf8d5eb41d471.webm?t=1792410424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/5763d5cf5cb28a4788acf8d5eb41d471.mp4?t=1792410424\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hit boost pads to pick up speed, then launch off jump ramps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race across the battlefield, chaining drifts and mid-air tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"45\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/83cbe84575097fb3a9e74bec0479cb46.webp?t=1792410424\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/26d64aad0fbb879f5e6df0d653262ac3.poster.avif?t=1792410424\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/26d64aad0fbb879f5e6df0d653262ac3.webm?t=1792410424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/26d64aad0fbb879f5e6df0d653262ac3.mp4?t=1792410424\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smash machines - and the CPUs and GPUs inside them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your score is the total cost of the damage you deal to the AI\u2019s machines. <br/>Wreck more and beat your personal best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"45\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/c5d274348375ad2146b3694c57f183f0.webp?t=1792410424\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/14c2a48a65e276733093d46d0ff7f51b.poster.avif?t=1792410424\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/14c2a48a65e276733093d46d0ff7f51b.webm?t=1792410424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/extras/14c2a48a65e276733093d46d0ff7f51b.mp4?t=1792410424\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place decals and cosmetic parts wherever you like, then take your custom tank into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Swing your cannon barrel and ram straight through an AI\u2019s machine army. A stylish single-player tank action game where the more you wreck, the more the AI pays.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186030/46bbf83331319ac674fb9c852e789bba072429ae/header.jpg?t=1792410424", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Spectacle fighter", "Hack and Slash", "Beat 'em up", "Driving", "PvE", "Action"], "developers": "Next Stage Inc.", "publishers": "Next Stage Inc.", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5186030", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "19 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/udVbHIc1KK4", "first_seen": 1792360800.0, "review_rank": 11}